  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Requests the number of lines in notecard <b>name</b> via the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Dataserver" target="_blank">dataserver</a> event (cast dataserver value to integer)</p>
  <p>Returns the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Key/handle" target="_blank">handle</a> (a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a>) for a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Dataserver" target="_blank">dataserver</a> event response.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string|uuid</span></td>
